CWD /nonexistent/path
LIST
MKD test
MKD a/b/c/d/e
MKD long_directory_name_12345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890
MKD special_chars_@
LIST
STOR testfile.txt
REST 100
RETR testfile.txt
QUIT

